### Verdict: SUPPORTED

### Justification
The fact-check confirms that Ruth Bader Ginsburg's 2020 Capitol ceremony was officially designated a ["lying in state"](https://www.cnbc.com/2020/09/21/ruth-bader-ginsburg-funeral-services-at-supreme-court-start-wednesday.html). According to the [Architect of the Capitol](https://www.aoc.gov/what-we-do/programs-ceremonies/lying-in-state-honor), all 34 individuals who previously lay in state were men, and no woman had received this specific honor before Ginsburg. While Rosa Parks lay [in honor](https://norton.house.gov/media-center/press-releases/october-28-2005-norton-says-unique-rosa-parks-rotunda-honor-her-example) in 2005, that is a distinct category. [Official announcements](https://forward.com/fast-forward/454868/ruth-bader-ginsburg-will-be-the-first-jew-and-first-woman-to-lie-in-state/) and a [Congressional Research Service report](https://www.everycrsreport.com/reports/IN11472.html) explicitly identify Ginsburg as the first woman to lie in state.